WEBVTT

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.190
What should I do?

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:51.000
Should I go, or should I not go?

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.000
I'll go!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.890
Labyrinth of the Stars

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:20.470
Hey, why don't we all go out and enjoy ourselves?

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:24.460
Lucia, did you finish your summer homework?

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:27.030
Eh? That is...

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.370
Ahh!

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.400
That's Hippo's voice!

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:35.860
What's wrong, Hippo!?

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.320
Lucia-san! It's surrounded us!

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.290
Look at what's surrounded Pearl Piari!

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.120
Surrounded?

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:43.840
Eh!?

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.740
What is this!?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.660
What in the world is this?

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:51.390
Could this be something caused by Mikeru?

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:55.670
No. They shouldn't know that we're here.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.420
This feels weird somehow.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.510
Eh!?

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.650
Are you okay, Lucia?

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:12.250
Hmm. Aside from this wall, nothing seems to be different.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:17.190
Something that looks ordinary and unchanged at first glance is usually the hardest to crack.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.690
Noelle! Where did you get those glasses?

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:23.480
We should proceed cautiously for now.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.730
The Encyclopedia of Paranormal Phenomena.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:34.610
If we consult this book, we may be able to understand what's going on.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:40.710
I have a feeling that this may not be the real Pearl Piari.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.020
H-How could that be?

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.310
This isn't the real Pearl Piari?

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:48.910
We'll need to investigate this thoroughly.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:49.730
Yeah.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.810
Alright, we'll go and take a look around the area.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.730
Be careful. We'll keep investigating here.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.270
Eh? Our clothes are...

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:07.120
They're now our school uniforms.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.730
What's going on?

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.190
I knew this was weird.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.740
If we're in our uniforms, maybe it has something to do with school.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.450
Let's go {over there and }take a look there.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:17.010
Okay.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.280
That's a good idea.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:28.910
Huh? Why is everyone at school during summer vacation?

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.910
What are you standing around for, Lucia?

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:40.240
Lucia, if you don't hurry up, homeroom will start without you.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:41.670
Now, let's hurry up!

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:46.220
You too, Rina, Hanon! Hurry!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:51.470
Who is that girl? Do we even have someone like her as a classmate?

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.030
Hmm.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:56.170
It seems that we're in a twisted version of our world.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:03.660
In any case, we should examine what exactly happened that led to this.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.860
To tell you the truth, there's something that I've been worried about.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:09.760
What is it, Hippo?

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:14.950
The words "the Cove of Miracles" have been on my mind.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.640
"The Cove of Miracles?"

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.560
Wait a minute.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:19.860
The Cove of Miracles.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.710
I remember that there was an entry regarding that here in the Encyclopedia of Paranormal Phenomena.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:26.230
I've got it. Here it is.{It's this:}

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:30.000
"Once every hundred years, on the night when the tide recedes to the lowest point,

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:35.680
if you make a wish in the Cove of Miracles, what you wish for will surely appear."

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.990
This seems unusual.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:44.550
I know. What it's describing sounds like what happened yesterday night.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:44.930
Eh?

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.210
Lucia, come on, let's go!

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:58.390
I somehow feel that I know that girl.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:01.840
Yeah, but I can't think of her name.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:04.920
This must be...

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.600
This is definitely the newest plasma TV that isn't even on the market yet.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.350
So that's what's going on.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.690
Are you ready? Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.780
Ahh. This breeze feels wonderful.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:56.640
Hey, I think you should tell us a little about yourself.

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:58.670
At least tell us your name.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:02.590
Even I'm not sure.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:07.460
But there is something that I'm wishing for here.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.860
Something you're wishing for?

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:10.700
Yeah.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:22.300
A peaceful world where everyone can be happy, with Lucia, Hanon, Rina, and everyone else by my side.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.190
A place where we can study and play together.

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:27.130
Huh?

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.420
I want to eat ice cream!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.950
Excuse me! We'd like to have some ice cream.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:38.410
Welcome!

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:41.430
Our ice cream is the tastiest and coolest around!

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.390
Why on Earth are you all here?

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.230
Oh my! You're the ones who live in that little hotel.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.000
The yakisoba is done!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.720
Hey! It's been a while.

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:54.170
It's been peaceful for us, since we haven't been fighting.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.790
Ah... yeah.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.000
Look! Look!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:02.980
Having our products revolve like this will be really fun!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.590
What's the purpose of that?

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.410
Because it's fun.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:09.620
My goodness, Eril.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:13.090
Uhh. S-So why did you open a store here?

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.290
Well, I don't really know myself.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.700
By the time I realized it, I was already here.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:21.520
Oh? Where is Yuuri?

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.590
Now that you mention it, I haven't seen her.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.060
She was just here doing the dishes.

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:30.100
Where did she go?

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.340
Here you go. Sorry for the wait.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:34.090
It looks yummy!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:36.460
Would the rest of you like some ice cream?

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.040
I'll give you a discount.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.510
We'll pass...

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:49.330
Umm, I just thought of something.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:56.270
Last night, I went to the that Cove of Miracles and made a wish!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.500
Eh!?

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.430
What did you say!?

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:00.590
But this is really strange.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:04.380
Even though Hippo went to the Cove of Miracles and made a wish...

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:07.960
...why did it also include us?

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:13.280
That's right. Maybe we were at the Cove of Miracles too.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:26.170
Where is he sneaking out to in the middle of the night?

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:29.810
What is Hippo doing at a place like this?

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:30.850
Hippo.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:36.850
It's odd to see the Mermaid Princesses out this late at night.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:39.910
How true. Maybe they're really bored?

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:46.240
Please! Please let me see Yuuri-san again!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.230
That explains it.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.210
There are rather strict requirements to invoke this magic.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:12.430
If other people are in the area of effect, they'll suffer short-term memory loss.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.600
So, this Pearl Piari is an illusion?

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:18.440
I think that is the case.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.190
I see.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.490
We're back!

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.190
Oh? Who is that girl?

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.030
She has something to do with this world.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.840
For now, we've brought her back.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:43.590
Eh!? You're the cause of this, Hippo!?

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:46.610
I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:52.830
It's because I couldn't suppress my desire to see Yuuri-san again!

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:53.680
Hippo.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.350
Listen to this.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:59.540
I found something interesting in the Cove of Miracles entry.{I found something of interest in the entry on the Cove of Miracles.}

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.540
It says that combining wishes may lead to despair.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:03.460
What's that about?

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.620
It sounds like a written warning.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:10.220
It means that if just one wish created this world, then there's no problem.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:16.820
But when wishes are combined, some of the wishes won't appear.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:22.350
I may have interfered with Hippo-san's wish without knowing.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:22.860
Huh?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:26.270
Normally, what Hippo-san wished for would have appeared.

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:31.000
He should have been able to happily meet the one he wanted to see the most.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.270
But at the same time, I also made a wish.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:38.410
I wanted to go to school with Lucia, Hanon, and Rina.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:39.490
I wanted to go shopping with you all.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.380
I... I'm sorry!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.210
Hey! Where are you going?

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:46.990
Wait!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.010
It's dangerous outside!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:54.050
If you want to see Yuuri, you'd better hurry, Hippo.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.510
The magic of the Cove of Miracles will disappear at sunrise.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:12:59.730
Okay.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:11.600
Yuuri-san is probably waiting at the place where we made the most memories together.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.440
It's the Black Beauty Sisters!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:23.270
When we saw that light spread across the cove, we were wondering what happened.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:24.690
How true.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:29.330
But fortunately for us, we ran into you here.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:33.860
Since you're here, the Mermaid Princesses must be nearby as well.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.810
Now, lead us to them.

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.380
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.050
Indigo Pearl Voice!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.120
Yellow Pearl Voice!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.950
We'll take care of this.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.380
Go and meet Yuuri, Hippo!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:53.760
Now, hurry!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.910
Okay! Everyone, thank you!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.830
You appeared by yourselves. Perfect!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.120
How true!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.170
It's Show Time!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:17.330
We've now captured three Mermaid Princesses.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.600
How true.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.790
Now we need to find the other three.

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.480
We're here!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:40.590
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:45.910
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:50.190
Green Pearl Voice!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.870
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.480
They're going to beat us again!

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:18.980
How true!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:37.800
This is a really bad habit we've got into!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:46.160
My head is a mess and I don't understand a thing!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.230
Yuuri-san!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:15.930
Hippo-sama!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.010
Love Shower Pitch!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.580
How about an encore?

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:17.600
How mean! You didn't show up until the very end!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.870
Why didn't you all show up at the same time!?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:26.140
I missed you so much, Yuuri-san.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.660
I missed you too, Hippo-sama.

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:39.090
I'm glad. Hippo got to see Yuuri again.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:48.400
Looks like we made it in time.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:51.370
I think our time's up.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.000
Yuuri-san.

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:56.780
Y-Yuuri-san is disappearing...

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:01.690
Yeah. Unfortunately, we have to say farewell, Hippo-sama.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.170
How could that be! We finally got to see each other again!

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:08.540
I've got so much to say to you!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.230
Just a little bit more time.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.220
Just enough for Hippo to say goodbye to Yuuri.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:17.150
Please, let time stop for them!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.650
Let me try, Lucia.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.510
Yuuri-san, goodbye.

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:03.480
That girl...

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:05.130
...was Seira.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:05.920
Yeah.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:11.050
I see now. Both Seira and Hippo had the same desire to see someone.

00:23:51.190 --> 00:23:53.310
My goodness, it's hot today.

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:54.590
That's true.

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:55.900
Oww, my back.

00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:59.210
Rina, you're just like an old lady.

00:23:59.210 --> 00:24:00.410
Oww, my knee.

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:04.820
What are you saying? I am' an old lady already!

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:04.820
What are you saying? I am' an old lady already!

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:05.840
That's right.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:12.620
I guess we need to find a way to become young again.

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:16.010
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:17.020
The Healing Song.

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:19.300
How about some hot tea?
